ep\"><h3><span class=\"n\">4</span>Проверка</h3><p>Подставляем найденные значения в уравнение, которое не использовали при решении:</p>\n      <div class=\"eq\"><span class=\"ln\">Σ<span class=\"v\">M</span><sub>A</sub> = <span class=\"v\">Y</span><sub>B</sub>·1 − <span class=\"v\">F</span>·4 = 0</span><span class=\"ln num\">26,667 − 26,667 = 0</span></div>\n      <span class=\"badge b-ok\">Верно: сумма равна нулю</span></div><div class=\"step\"><h3><span class=\"n\">5</span>Ответ</h3><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"ans\"><tbody><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"val\"><span class=\"v\">X</span><sub>B</sub> = 0 кН</td><td class=\"note\"></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"val\"><span class=\"v\">Y</span><sub>B</sub> = 26,667 кН</td><td class=\"note\"></td></tr><tr class=\"total\"><td class=\"val\"><span class=\"v\">R</span><sub>B</sub> = √(<span class=\"v\">X</span><sub>B</sub>² + <span class=\"v\">Y</span><sub>B</sub>²) = 26,667 кН</td><td class=\"note\">полная реакция</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"val\"><span class=\"v\">F</span> = 6,667 кН</td><td class=\"note\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
